[b]Tokyo Babefest[/b] event will begin on April 9!
The current event, [b]Catgirl Frenzy[/b], will be live until Overlord's departure to Tokyo, so use that time to spend your event resources and finish the quests.

[b]Tokyo Babefest features:[/b]
[list]
[*] [b]two hot guest matriarchs[/b] - [b]Xissea & Yvy[/b] - with three hot scenes for you to unlock;
[*] [b]two battle characters[/b]: [b]Cyborg[/b] and the brand-new [b]Maid[/b];
[*] event's exclusive [b]sex scenes[/b];
[*] [b]new quests and challenges[/b];
[*] [b]collectibles[/b] — this powerful items will make your Overlord [b]even stronger[/b];
[/list]
You'll see a [b]new event character (Maid)[/b] at the beginning of the event on enemy teams. You will be able to add [b]Maid[/b] to your harem starting [b]May 9[/b].

